{"chapter-slug":"rw7-36 C","paragraph":450,"wording":"[Secretary]","event":"named","holder-slug":"quiteil","holder-quote":"The [Secretary] picked at the corruption on his right arm as he keyed a group of speaking stones. Instantly, they lit up as the Night-Commanders on duty for 4th Wall gave their codes and reports. Nothing new. One reported eighteen bats; a completely irrelevant detail in most other armies that would have got him laughed at for paranoia.","id":"157844ec-a50a-5a6e-8bd6-fd2fd93bb9d5"}
