{"chapter-slug":"rw8-05 I","paragraph":314,"wording":"[Secretary]","event":"named","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"Alrric","holder-quote":"“Not just from that. Yes, she was as good as they came. Better than me, although I wasn’t as good as I am at the time. The highest-leveled [Secretary] in all of Salazsar.”","id":"f0da74f1-f763-561b-ac1b-b6dcbf64380b"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-05 I","paragraph":328,"wording":"[Secretary]","event":"named","holder-quote":"Ilvriss sat back with a sigh. Salii the [Secretary]. There was something to it. But a [Secretary] wouldn’t be useful against the Necromancer.","id":"a01a534b-fa51-5a33-bc79-607ebfee2fdc"}
