{"chapter-slug":"rw8-37 H","paragraph":26,"wording":"[Secretary]","event":"named","holder-slug":"salii","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"salii","holder-quote":"Do you have any objections, Strongest of Pomle? I’m here to serve. I am Pomle’s [Secretary]. Just say the word.","id":"0e06b7c1-7054-562c-9191-af01faa6e015"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-37 H","paragraph":58,"wording":"[Secretary]","event":"named","holder-slug":"salii","holder-quote":"Salii’s brows rose high, and Orjin saw many nod, including himself. If the [Secretary] had expected Pomle’s warriors to be thoughtless—years of solitary practice gave you plenty of time to think.","id":"4c9a17f7-d514-5bda-878d-056ddafffecd"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-37 H","paragraph":81,"wording":"[Secretary]","event":"named","holder-slug":"salii","holder-quote":"The Drake [Secretary] frowned. She eyed Chein.","id":"8afb7bfd-ff44-5042-acf0-9faa7914a8fd"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-37 H","paragraph":109,"wording":"[Secretary]","event":"named","holder-slug":"salii","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"salii","holder-quote":"Because it can be better, Orjin. As Pomle, the training ground for [Martial Artists], not just ‘better’ in a nebulous sense. I came here to do just that, to test myself as a [Secretary] against the most stubborn idiots in this entire continent of sand.","id":"22243f7d-0c58-52cd-94f2-59f05ade1b41"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-37 H","paragraph":121,"wording":"[Secretary]","event":"named","holder-slug":"salii","holder-quote":"The [Secretary] wagged a claw at Orjin. He sat back.","id":"836fc6ee-a9de-50b0-9b18-475888b2ea56"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-37 H","paragraph":126,"wording":"[Secretary]","event":"named","holder-slug":"salii","holder-quote":"The [Secretary] pursed her lips.","id":"0e0bd639-e1f3-5c89-9995-dd47ce593aed"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-37 H","paragraph":140,"wording":"[Secretary]","event":"named","holder-slug":"salii","holder-quote":"Orjin did. Gently; he was fairly sure he could hit Salii, whatever she wanted to show off or not. The [Secretary] spun, and her clipboard hit the cup. It bounced back at Orjin, nearly twice as fast.","id":"e015126b-244f-5ec9-aa9c-02a1c72a03cb"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-37 H","paragraph":141,"wording":"[Secretary]","event":"named","holder-slug":"salii","holder-quote":"He actually caught most of the tea back with it. It was the same trick she’d done when he’d fought the Shame of the Wind or whatever that fool had been. He’d thought it had been a fairly good defensive skill for a [Secretary], but now he realized it had a bit more power than he","id":"8359446e-bc46-591e-9927-5b2b53da6ff5"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-37 H","paragraph":144,"wording":"[Secretary]","event":"named","holder-slug":"salii","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"orjin","holder-quote":"That is an…exceptionally poor Level 50 Skill. Even for a [Secretary].","id":"93a39b21-a8d5-5677-9ce4-b348435371dd"}
